{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Engines the M0 benchmark (and later the apps) can use. Model ids live here, not in code. Prices in USD, checked 2026-10-26. rpm = requests per minute the benchmark allows itself (keep under the free tier). gemini-2.5-flash-lite was dropped on 2026-10-27: Google no longer offers it to new users. llama-3.1-8b-instant was replaced by openai/gpt-oss-120b on 2026-10-27: Groq no longer offers Llama 3.1 8B on standard keys. concurrency = requests the benchmark keeps in flight per provider (start times still follow rpm).",
